What is Public Transport Insurance?
Public Transport Insurance refers to an insurance product that provides comprehensive protection for individuals who utilize public transportation systems. This insurance is specifically designed to reduce the financial burden on passengers resulting from accidental injuries sustained while commuting via public transportation modes, including buses, subways, trains, ships, and airplanes. The coverage encompasses two primary product types-Traffic Accident Insurance and Compulsory Traffic Insurance-and serves both personal and commercial applications across global markets.
